      "refersTo": "button-inverse",
      "description": "Export action on the dark shell; the frame reproduces its actual context.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-shell\"><button class=\"ds-export\">Export record <svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 3v9m-3-3 3 3 3-3M4 13v4h12v-4\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-export{border:1px solid var(--line,#dce3dc);border-radius:5px;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#1c2b27);min-height:36px;padding:7px 12px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;white-space:nowrap;font:600 12px/1.5 var(--font,Plex,Arial,sans-serif);cursor:pointer;transition:background 150ms ease-out;background:transparent;color:#e8f1eb;border-color:#527265}.ds-export:hover:not(:disabled){background:#294f43}.ds-export:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#1f6954);outline-offset:4px}.ds-export:disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.45}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-export{min-height:40px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-export{transition:none}}.ds-shell{background:var(--shell,#183d35);padding:16px;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end}.ds-export:focus-visible{outline-color:#c2e4d1}.ds-export svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-linecap:round;flex:none}@media(max-width:480px){.ds-export{font-size:11px;padding:6px 8px;gap:5px}}"
